<div id="recipe-22810-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-22810-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="22810"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-22810-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;"><strong>To make the dressing: </strong>Whisk together the olive oil, lime zest, lime juice, ground cumin, smoked paprika, salt, honey and garlic. Set it aside.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person making Texas caviar dressing with lime juice." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-dip.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-22810-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;"><strong>For the Texas Caviar dip (or salad): </strong>Place, black beans, black eyed peas, corn kernels, scallions, red onion, bell peppers, jalapeno pepper, cherry tomatoes, avocado, and fresh cilantro in a bowl.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="The ingredients for Cowboy caviar in a bowl from the top view." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ultimate-cowboy-caviar-recipe.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-22810-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Drizzle it with the dressing and give it a gentle toss. Taste for seasoning and add in if necessary.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person drizzling the salad with dressing and mixing it." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cowboy-caviar-with-black-beans.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-22810-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">If preferred, add in a few dashes of your favorite hot sauce and serve with tortilla chips.</span></div></li></ul></div></div>
